{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33674","headline":"省试腊後望春宫 · 林宽","name":"省试腊後望春宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇都初度腊，凤辇出深宫。\n高凭楼台上，遥瞻灞滻中。\n仗凝霜彩白，袍映日华红。\n柳眼方开冻，莺声渐转风。\n御沟穿断霭，骊岫照斜空。\n时见宸游兴，因观稼穑功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林宽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33674.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33674","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}